ance at me.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">地理</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">地理</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"160821\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はこの<ruby>町<rp>(</rp><rt>まち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>地理<rp>(</rp><rt>ちり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をよく<ruby>知<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I am familiar with the geography of this town.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">塵</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">灰尘；尘埃；垃圾；废物；污垢；尘土；微不足道的量；极少量；尘世喧嚣；世俗烦扰；俗世尘劳；（相扑）尘手水；力士赛前搓掌展臂、表示手无暗器光明交锋的仪式动作</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"143903\"><ruby>塵<rp>(</rp><rt>ちり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も<ruby>積<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>もれば<ruby>山<rp>(</rp><rt>やま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>となる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Many a little makes a mickle.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">塵紙</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちりがみ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">纸巾；卫生纸</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">塵取り</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちりとり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid