\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">チームワーク</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">团队合作；团队配合</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"79652\"><ruby>野球<rp>(</rp><rt>やきゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>最<rp>(</rp><rt>もっと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>もすばらしいところはチームワークだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The most wonderful thing about baseball is teamwork.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">追加</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ついか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">添加；补充；附加；附录</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227855\">エントリーはすべて、<ruby>追加<rp>(</rp><rt>ついか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>後<rp>(</rp><rt>あと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にチェックします。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">All entries are subject to review once added.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">追及</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ついきゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">追查；审问；追问；逼问；追上；赶上；超越</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"125699\"><ruby>追及<rp>(</rp><rt>ついきゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>されて、つい、<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>え<ruby>透<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いた<ruby>嘘<rp>(</rp><rt>うそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をついてしまった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I was pressed by their questioning and slipped into telling an obvious lie.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">追跡</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ついせき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">追逐；追捕；跟踪；尾随；追溯；追查</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"211193\">その<ruby>警官<rp>(</rp><rt>けいかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>泥棒<rp>(</rp><rt>どろぼう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>追跡<rp>(</rp><rt>ついせき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The policeman chased the thief.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ついで</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">机会；时机；场合；顺序；次序；继任者；后继者</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"121505\"><ruby>買<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>物<rp>(</rp><rt>もの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ついでにでもお<ruby>寄<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Please drop by when you go out for shopping sometimes.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">次いで</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ついで</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">其次；接着；随后</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"205271\">それは<ruby>教育<rp>(</rp><rt>きょういく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>次<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いで<ruby>大<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きな<ruby>問題<rp>(</rp><rt>もんだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">That is the principle problem next to education.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">遂に</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ついに</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">最终；终于；到底；结果；终究；始终（未发生）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"111891\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はついに<ruby>大学<rp>(</rp><rt>だいがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>学長<rp>(</rp><rt>がくちょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>辞任<rp>(</rp><rt>じにん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He finally resigned the presidency of the college.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">追放</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ついほう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">流放；放逐；驱逐；遣送；清洗；开除；罢免；消除；排除（如消除贫困）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"168217\"><ruby>支配者<rp>(</rp><rt>しはいしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>打倒<rp>(</rp><rt>だとう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>され<ruby>国外<rp>(</rp><rt>こくがい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>追放<rp>(</rp><rt>ついほう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>された。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The ruler was overthrown and banished from the country.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">費やす</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ついやす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">花费；支出；消耗；浪费；挥霍；浪掷；投入；奉献</span></div><div cla