=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The authorities managed to stabilize the currency.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">通過</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つうか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">通过（隧道、车站、城镇等）；经过；过境；通过（议案等）；批准；获得通过；通过（考试、检查等）；及格；获得资格</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"125585\"><ruby>通過<rp>(</rp><rt>つうか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する<ruby>車<rp>(</rp><rt>くるま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>気<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をつけなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Watch out for passing cars.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">痛感</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つうかん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">深切感受；充分认识</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"230943\">あの<ruby>事故<rp>(</rp><rt>じこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>て<ruby>自然<rp>(</rp><rt>しぜん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>力<rp>(</rp><rt>ちから</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>痛感<rp>(</rp><rt>つうかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">That accident brought home to me the power of nature.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">通学</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つうがく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">上学；上下学</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"203957\">たいていの<ruby>