p></ruby>は、<ruby>無電<rp>(</rp><rt>むでん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>通信<rp>(</rp><rt>つうしん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>送<rp>(</rp><rt>おく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He sent a message by wireless.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">通常</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つうじょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">通常；寻常；普通；正常；一般；普遍</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"147241\"><ruby>女性<rp>(</rp><rt>じょせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>通常<rp>(</rp><rt>つうじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>男性<rp>(</rp><rt>だんせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>よりも<ruby>長生<rp>(</rp><rt>ながい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きする。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Women commonly live longer than men.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">通じる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つうじる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">开放通行；连通；沟通；流动；通过；传达；被理解；被领会；得到认可；行得通；精通；熟悉；秘密联系；与敌方保持联络；建立联系；有来往；亲密；广泛传播；散布</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"87767\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>電話<rp>(</rp><rt>でんわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>通<rp>(</rp><rt>つう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じるとすぐ<ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し<ruby>始<rp>(</rp><rt>はじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She started talking as soon as she got through.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">通ずる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つうずる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"v-m\">（道路）通行；通往；相通；联络；（液体、电流）流通；通过；通达；到达；被理解；被领会；通用；被认可；有效；精通；深知；暗中勾结；私通（敌方）；暗通消息；私通；发生暧昧关系；关系亲密</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"218421\">これは<ruby>古今東西<rp>(</rp><rt>ここんとうざい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>通<rp>(</rp><rt>つう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ずる<ruby>真理<rp>(</rp><rt>しんり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>である。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">This is a universal truth that transcends time.</span></div></li>"]